Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Floorline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Floorline is a money app on near testnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,People can hold a token called floor, borrow against it, and check\Nthe important moves with public receipts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No guesswork.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.21,0:00:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the simple picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Floor has near backing you can inspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Loans are funded by lenders, not by the treasury.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And the right to repay a loan can move to someone else as an N F T.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When floor is redeemed, the contract creates a near payout claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This finalized testnet transaction shows that withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone borrows, a lender puts up the money and the borrower\Nlocks floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here the N F T changes hands, and the new owner completes repayment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That right is financial, not artwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If nobody repays in time, the contract settles the default and\Nallocates collateral to the lender.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,After the demo, we permanently stopped new financial risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we verified an existing user could still exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Both receipts are public.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty acceptance steps were verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Judges can open the proof page and run read-only checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Floorline: programmable money with verifiable rights, built on near.
